      "originalText": "- Can use to sroll wheal, drag (on cards, mouse or touch), drag (scroll bar) \n- code say this card is in X% and web/html/css/other JS automaticly\n  rotate card.\n- In data/ i have YAML of projects, to add new card i edit YAML and pelican\n  automaticli bake in html all cards",
